### Get all tasks
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tasks


### Create future task
POST http://localhost:8080/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Complete Task Planner",
  "description": "Finish the Kenac Software Engineering assessment",
  "dueDate": "2026-10-01",
  "priority": "HIGH",
  "status": "TODO"
}


### Create overdue task
POST http://localhost:8080/api/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Old Report",
  "description": "Past due acceptance test task",
  "dueDate": "2026-09-20",
  "priority": "LOW",
  "status": "TODO"
}


### Search by title
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tasks?search=Planner


### Filter by HIGH priority
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tasks?priority=HIGH


### Filter by TODO status
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tasks?status=TODO


### Combined filters
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tasks?status=TODO&priority=HIGH


### Get overdue tasks
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tasks/overdue


### Get statistics
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tasks/statistics


### Mark task ID 2 as DONE
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/tasks/2/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "DONE"
}


### Get overdue tasks after marking task Done
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tasks/overdue


### Statistics after marking task Done
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tasks/statistics